.1920x1080.jpg?t=1758722360","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747330/cf46866f2d05f156f41bcba7d71ae1e43efc7259/ss_cf46866f2d05f156f41bcba7d71ae1e43efc7259.600x338.jpg?t=1758722360"},{"id":12,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747330/a02f750d2183221edfbccda30edb6b214988096f/ss_a02f750d2183221edfbccda30edb6b214988096f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1758722360","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747330/a02f750d2183221edfbccda30edb6b214988096f/ss_a02f750d2183221edfbccda30edb6b214988096f.600x338.jpg?t=1758722360"},{"id":13,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747330/d5ff0457541fff8302807f4db058ab43d5e988e3/ss_d5ff0457541fff8302807f4db058ab43d5e988e3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1758722360","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747330/d5ff0457541fff8302807f4db058ab43d5e988e3/ss_d5ff0457541fff8302807f4db058ab43d5e988e3.600x338.jpg?t=1758722360"}],"short_description":"Species: Unknown is a 1 to 4 players co-op survival horror. Complete high-risk missions aboard an abandoned ship while being hunted by an unknown creature. Survive and upgrade your gear to face each new threat that lurks in the dark.","steam_appid":2747330,"support_info":{"email":"contact@wanadevstudio.com","url":"https://discord.com/invite/DKHk5rQ"},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":"https://www.species-unknown-game.com/"}